ather than tracking `body_entered`/`exited`, so a block that melts on the pad can't leave it stuck. A child `StaticBody2D` pedestal (layer 2, joins `"water_solid"`, deliberately not `"ground"`/`"catwalk"` so it can't be ledge-grabbed) has a collider whose top follows the middle of the art's oval per frame (`SURFACE_TOP_PX`), resized on a per-instance shape. Sounds `interactive/button_press`/`interactive/button_release` follow `active`.
